# GitHub Actions API Endpoints

## Endpoints Covered
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/workflows` — List workflows
- `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/actions/runs` — List workflow runs

## Test Data
- Primary fixture: `actions/checkout` (popular repo with CI workflows)
- Constants in `data/actions_constants.py`
